  "details": "When the normal map is placed in the shader \"Toon Standard\" the shading for it doesn't work properly, rather it freezes in place while either the \"realistic\" or \"Toon Band\" shading moves with the directional lighting. This issue is only for Quest however. No issue like this on PC, at least for my side of things (I cannot speak for everyone) (I will attempt to attach a video example of the issue, if not DM me for the videos. TengenOfficial on discord) This shader has so much potential, I wouldn't want this to ruin it for some.",
